  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stichting Vluchteling</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to the escalating food insecurity in Somalia, the Joint Response delivers coordinated, multi-sectoral life-saving assistance to communities facing extreme hunger and displacement. Activities focus on food security, nutrition, health, WASH andcash assistance for example through rehabilitation of water sources, food voucher distributions, treatment of acute malnutrition and provides(mobile) primary health care. Vulnerable households receive multipurpose cash to meet urgent basic needs, while protection is mainstreamed to ensure safe and accountable support.</narrative>
  </description>
