  </participating-org>
  <participating-org ref="NL-KVK-41149486" role="4" type="21">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stichting Vluchteling (Refugee Foundation Netherlands) is synonymous with direct aid for victims of acute distress. Worldwide our aim is directed to refugees and displaced persons. They respond to the worlds worst humanitarian crisis, providing emergencyaid, shelter, medical care, food, clearn drinking water and sanitary facilities for those in need.

Since 2015 they are in partnership with ICR, they are also part of Giro555</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stichting Vluchteling</narrative>
